{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_18107661","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18107661","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1810762101:0":{"text":"爱丝将解药交到了里纳手中。然而，里纳却似乎有些犹豫。","source_cn":"爱丝将解药交到了里纳手中。然而，里纳却似乎有些犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E5E3C54218FCA8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810762102:1":{"text":"怎么了？这瓶药有什么不对吗？","source_cn":"怎么了？这瓶药有什么不对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x700B78B3C1061D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810762103:0":{"text":"不……不是。我只是有点……犹豫。","source_cn":"不……不是。我只是有点……犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AE6A7586BE86EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1810762103":{"text":"不……不是。我只是有点……犹豫。","source_cn":"不……不是。我只是有点……犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AE6A7586BE86EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810762104:0":{"text":"……我害怕恢复记忆以后，就会理解你和瑟恩所做的一切。","source_cn":"……我害怕恢复记忆以后，就会理解你和瑟恩所做的一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9867B90CD9EF2CF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810762105:0":{"text":"可是这样……或许对穆婆婆不公平。","source_cn":"可是这样……或许对穆婆婆不公平。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E7D007E36FA8231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810762106:0":{"text":"我不奢求你的理解和原谅。下定决心阻拦你的那一刻，我就已经做好了准备。","source_cn":"我不奢求你的理解和原谅。下定决心阻拦你的那一刻，我就已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3F7FD8F5EFD785B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810762107:0":{"text":"你也可以拒绝恢复记忆，以“里纳”的身份继续活下去。","source_cn":"你也可以拒绝恢复记忆，以“里纳”的身份继续活下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4B57456786B16EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810762108:1":{"text":"………………\n你明知道“巴登”不会这样做。","source_cn":"………………\\n你明知道“巴登”不会这样做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D72C8AD238A2D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810762109:0":{"text":"无论你作何选择，我都不会有怨言。我已发誓守护爱丝和瑞恩家族，至死方休。","source_cn":"无论你作何选择，我都不会有怨言。我已发誓守护爱丝和瑞恩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x516A1B4F3F1764E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810762110:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1810762111:0":{"text":"巴登先生……不，里纳先生。若你不介意，请听听我作为亡灵的想法。","source_cn":"巴登先生……不，里纳先生。若你不介意，请听听我作为亡灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B78D79AB13E0643","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810762112:0":{"text":"虽然不清楚事情的具体经过，但我想，穆婆婆所做的一切必定都由她主动，出自她的本心。包括牺牲自己、拯救你的决定。","source_cn":"虽然不清楚事情的具体经过，但我想，穆婆婆所做的一切必定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C23C86BA8942DA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1810762113:0":{"text":"毕竟她对你的爱护，每一位修缮屋的客人都有目共睹。","source_cn":"毕竟她对你的爱护，每一位修缮屋的客人都有目共睹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x837FF8EBFBBA2DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1810762114:1":{"text":"就是因为这样，我才无法原谅自己……！","source_cn":"就是因为这样，我才无法原谅自己……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA75BFDC342FBAAFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810762115:1":{"text":"我明白你的痛苦。但这不是生命的终点。","source_cn":"我明白你的痛苦。但这不是生命的终点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x387D53938AB0A775","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1810762116:1":{"text":"就像死亡不是生者的终点，消散也不是亡灵的终点。<style=\"highlight\">遗忘，才是一切的终结</style>。","source_cn":"就像死亡不是生者的终点，消散也不是亡灵的终点。<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x666613B06C013092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1810762117:1":{"text":"遗忘……","source_cn":"遗忘……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F7A4A3AAB1BA699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1810762118:1":{"text":"是的。如同我所演出的《消逝之声》那样，只要你记得穆婆婆，她的灵魂与意志就将永存。","source_cn":"是的。如同我所演出的《消逝之声》那样，只要你记得穆婆婆...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77B8B134F3258053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1810762119:1":{"text":"你的生命，你的人生，是她拼尽全力也要保护的最宝贵之物。若你颓废度日，她必定会为此心痛。","source_cn":"你的生命，你的人生，是她拼尽全力也要保护的最宝贵之物。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DD0EC65C26231AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1810762120:1":{"text":"请不要辜负她的牺牲。找回属于你的过去，带着对她的思念活下去，将她对你的爱护——跨越生死界限的情谊，传递给更多人。","source_cn":"请不要辜负她的牺牲。找回属于你的过去，带着对她的思念活...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F1B5CDB2F34CC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1810762121:1":{"text":"跨越生死……","source_cn":"跨越生死……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD475DE7F0972BC30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1810762122:1":{"text":"……我明白了。","source_cn":"……我明白了。<key:dialog803>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x958508793A16C8F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:31:1810763101:":{"text":"呃……！","source_cn":"呃……！<key:dialog8016>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A25E4A98FD29298","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:31:1810763102:":{"text":"巴登！","source_cn":"巴登！<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB63726CD6A415135","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1810764101:1":{"text":"我……我的记忆……我想起来了……","source_cn":"我……我的记忆……我想起来了……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5900424F14BBB7DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1810764102:0":{"text":"呜呜呜……巴登！","source_cn":"呜呜呜……巴登！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F10982E36DB6F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1810764103:0":{"text":"……想起来就好。","source_cn":"……想起来就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A366B7C91645427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1810764104:0":{"text":"好啦，爱丝……你现在可是家主，不能再哭鼻子了。","source_cn":"好啦，爱丝……你现在可是家主，不能再哭鼻子了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC722CB5E5E53E1E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1810764105:0":{"text":"还有瑟恩，你不应该更高兴吗？笑一笑吧。","source_cn":"还有瑟恩，你不应该更高兴吗？笑一笑吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E99B3573A7E021D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1810764106:0":{"text":"……你不必这样强颜欢笑。","source_cn":"……你不必这样强颜欢笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44DE5247598FF46A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1810764107:0":{"text":"………………","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1810764108:0":{"text":"穆婆婆的事……对不起。那是我必须做的选择。","source_cn":"穆婆婆的事……对不起。那是我必须做的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE085D1BA5F959F3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1810764109:1":{"text":"……嗯，我知道。","source_cn":"……嗯，我知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD2944543751FE2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1810764110:0":{"text":"谢谢你，瑟恩。培养爱丝、寻找我、一次次舍身救我……你已经为我做了太多，别再自责了。","source_cn":"谢谢你，瑟恩。培养爱丝、寻找我、一次次舍身救我……你已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C1594582819F5A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1810764111:0":{"text":"我不会责怪你，更不会恨你。\n只是我现在……有点悲伤。","source_cn":"我不会责怪你，更不会恨你。\\n只是我现在……有点悲伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B31024BAAEEC5FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1810764112:0":{"text":"巴登……","source_cn":"巴登……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F18279B6D894431","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1810764113:0":{"text":"我们一直与班题斯为敌，总觉得亡灵全是毫无人性的怪物。可是……为了救我，穆婆婆甘愿牺牲自己……","source_cn":"我们一直与班题斯为敌，总觉得亡灵全是毫无人性的怪物。可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CA52F6FD9647C8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1810764114:1":{"text":"虽然她的确受到了巴亚茄老师记忆的影响……但在我以“里纳”这个名字生活的时候，她对我的照管和爱护不是假的。","source_cn":"虽然她的确受到了巴亚茄老师记忆的影响……但在我以“里纳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BFF534D97E019FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1810764115:1":{"text":"她是亡灵，也知道我是生者……而我现在，正在为她的离开而痛苦。","source_cn":"她是亡灵，也知道我是生者……而我现在，正在为她的离开而痛苦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC41E7A1CEEDAA67C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1810764116:1":{"text":"我……","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog858>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA388BF99B2CD5A83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1810764117:1":{"text":"………………","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1810764118:1":{"text":"你还记得我们教官常说的话吧？“有人倒下后——”","source_cn":"你还记得我们教官常说的话吧？“有人倒下后——”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE097DFB081A1229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1810764119:1":{"text":"“——我们便是他的未竟之路。”","source_cn":"“——我们便是他的未竟之路。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738768732D4174E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1810764120:1":{"text":"所以，你好好活着，就不负她的牺牲。","source_cn":"所以，你好好活着，就不负她的牺牲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB16603ED2EC6E86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1810764121:0":{"text":"……嗯。","source_cn":"……嗯。<key:dialog808>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA83B645BB6A5DBAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1810764122:0":{"text":"对了，为什么你和爱丝都跑到诺珐斯来了？灰影郡战况如何？现在是谁留守？","source_cn":"对了，为什么你和爱丝都跑到诺珐斯来了？灰影郡战况如何？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECFAFF227F6BF556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1810764123:0":{"text":"对不起。瑟恩离开后，我实在没法安心待在灰影郡干等着。","source_cn":"对不起。瑟恩离开后，我实在没法安心待在灰影郡干等着。<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42AB1C2B2DC0C18E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1810764124:0":{"text":"所以……我就擅自离岗了。但你不用担心，我把能想到的事情都做了！","source_cn":"所以……我就擅自离岗了。但你不用担心，我把能想到的事情...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97E237D4EA37395B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1810764125:0":{"text":"爱丝特瑞达向巴登简单叙述了一遍她的安排。","source_cn":"爱丝特瑞达向巴登简单叙述了一遍她的安排。<key:di...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC988A36AC084E5B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1810764126:1":{"text":"干得好，爱丝……你比以前稳重了很多。不愧是我们瑞恩家族的家主。","source_cn":"干得好，爱丝……你比以前稳重了很多。不愧是我们瑞恩家族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB864BAAF3FF7CC9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1810764127:1":{"text":"巴登，我擅离职守，不配再为家主，理应受罚。","source_cn":"巴登，我擅离职守，不配再为家主，理应受罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E1956B82D517C18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1810764128:1":{"text":"等你回到灰影郡后，以家主的身份处置我吧。","source_cn":"等你回到灰影郡后，以家主的身份处置我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6CFB30BA04723A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1810764129:1":{"text":"不，爱丝……<style=\"highlight\">我暂时不会回灰影郡</style>。","source_cn":"不，爱丝……<style=highlight>我暂时不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0652B54B260E0E7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:68:1810764130:1":{"text":"那你要去哪里？！","source_cn":"那你要去哪里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8559F8251943F8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1810764131:1":{"text":"去幽声群岛，看看那里的情况。","source_cn":"去幽声群岛，看看那里的情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB4A97F44A5A1F8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1810764132:1":{"text":"巴亚茄老师的肢体被穆婆婆所继承，说明幽声群岛的战况不容乐观。我不能坐视不理。","source_cn":"巴亚茄老师的肢体被穆婆婆所继承，说明幽声群岛的战况不容...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6615AD7BD8C70A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:71:1810764133:0":{"text":"可是你才刚找回记忆！至少……至少也该回灰影郡看看……","source_cn":"可是你才刚找回记忆！至少……至少也该回灰影郡看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20CAE50921BD16EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1810764134:0":{"text":"咳……呵呵呵……","source_cn":"咳……呵呵呵……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19867A66BF22B520","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1810764135:0":{"text":"伴随着轻快的笑声，苔佩希的身影忽然出现在了你身边。","source_cn":"伴随着轻快的笑声，苔佩希的身影忽然出现在了你身边。<k...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x36016168AD06ECA9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"伴随着轻快的笑声，苔佩希的身影忽然出现在了你身边。","female":"伴随着轻快的笑声，苔佩希的身影忽然出现在了你身边。","variant_male_record_index":"244915","variant_female_record_index":"244916","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1810764136:0":{"text":"瑞恩小姐，你太天真了。幽声群岛的现状比你们的预估更为可怕。","source_cn":"瑞恩小姐，你太天真了。幽声群岛的现状比你们的预估更为可怕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD49AB88618DA463","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1810764137:0":{"text":"来吧，让余的信使给你们看看班题斯的情报。","source_cn":"来吧，让余的信使给你们看看班题斯的情报。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE640BA95DCFB4A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:80:1810765001:":{"text":"就是这份文件","source_cn":"就是这份文件","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6A8E718D17E8DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"document:81:614:0":{"text":"………………\n传闻霍德希金所率领的死潮舰队已于耀光帝国锈锚港覆灭，班题斯遗失之圣器落入一魔法师手中，其身份尚不明确。\n追踪死潮舰队的军方船队已转向。班题斯并没有将锈锚港列为应征服地区。\n………………\n班题斯军方船队已抵达耀光帝国边陲的幽声群岛，支援此地军队。群岛土著居民落入下风。\n………………\n耀光帝国幽声群岛